1. Original software source code is licensed under the MIT License. This
   includes Python and PowerShell source files, tests, CI configuration, and
   project packaging configuration. See LICENSE-CODE.

2. Course documentation and generated publications are licensed under the
   Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International
