   experiment-report templates, included educational datasets, and generated
   PDF study guides. See LICENSE-DOCS.

3. Third-party material remains under its original license. See
   ATTRIBUTION.md for the Happy-LLM reference, source, license, and a summary of
   the changes made in this project.

If a file contains an explicit license notice, that notice takes precedence.
Otherwise, use the categories above. No license is granted for third-party
trademarks, logos, or material that the repository contributors do not have the
right to license.
